      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} explodes [[lookup @activation.condition activity=1SfqWSp7RSyHgG4b]].</p><p><em>Constitution Saving Throw: </em>DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=1SfqWSp7RSyHgG4b]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=1SfqWSp7RSyHgG4b]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=1SfqWSp7RSyHgG4b]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}.</p><p><em>Failure: </em>[[/damage average]] damage.</p><p><em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: When the creature gains the Dead status, every creature in the emanation makes the save.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
